<main id="main">
<section class="phero"><div class="phero-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/bluegrass-horse-country.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/bluegrass-horse-country-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/bluegrass-horse-country.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="784" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.08"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Regions served</li></ol></nav><p class="eyebrow on-dark">Statewide coverage</p><h1>Insurance Appraisal Across All 120 Kentucky Counties</h1><p class="lede">Kentucky Insurance Appraiser takes work statewide — from the Mississippi River bluffs to the Big Sandy. These pages cover the cities where our files come from most often.</p><p class="btns"><a class="btn coral" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ghost-l" href="/contact-us/">Free claim review</a></p></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="icards" data-stagger><a class="icard" href="/regions-served/louisville/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/louisville-downtown.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/louisville-downtown-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/louisville-downtown.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="725" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Louisville Metro · Jefferson County</small><h2>Louisville</h2><span>When your insurer’s number does not match the real cost to repair a Louisville home or building, the appraisal clause gives you a way to settle the amount without a lawsuit. We inspect on site across Jefferson County and build the estimate that carries your side.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/regions-served/lexington/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/lexington-horse-farm.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/lexington-horse-farm-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/lexington-horse-farm.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>The Bluegrass · Fayette County</small><h2>Lexington</h2><span>Lexington claims range from a Chevy Chase bungalow with storm damage to a horse barn on the edge of the county. We serve all of Fayette County and help owners use the appraisal clause when the carrier’s figure falls short.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/regions-served/bowling-green/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/bowling-green-wku.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/bowling-green-wku-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/bowling-green-wku.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="495" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>South Central Kentucky · Warren County</small><h2>Bowling Green</h2><span>Bowling Green has seen overnight tornadoes and sits on some of the most famous karst in the country. We help Warren County owners settle disputed claim amounts through the appraisal clause.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/regions-served/owensboro/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/owensboro-riverfront.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/owensboro-riverfront-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/owensboro-riverfront.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="792" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Western Kentucky · Daviess County</small><h2>Owensboro</h2><span>Owensboro’s river location and open farmland bring ice, wind and water claims in equal measure. We help Daviess County owners document the full repair cost and settle disputes through appraisal.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/regions-served/covington/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/covington-bridge.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/covington-bridge-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/covington-bridge.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Northern Kentucky · Kenton County</small><h2>Covington</h2><span>Covington’s brick row houses and steep hillsides make for claims that generic estimates rarely price correctly. We serve Kenton County and the rest of Northern Kentucky with on-site inspections and appraisal representation.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/regions-served/richmond/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/horses-graze.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/horses-graze-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/horses-graze.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="772" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>The Bluegrass · Madison County</small><h2>Richmond</h2><span>From student rentals near campus to farmhouses toward Berea, Madison County properties face wind, hail and ice. We help owners use the appraisal clause to resolve disputed claim amounts.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/regions-served/elizabethtown/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/country-brick.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/country-brick-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/country-brick.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Louisville Metro · Hardin County</small><h2>Elizabethtown</h2><span>Elizabethtown and the Lincoln Trail area combine growing subdivisions, military-family housing and rural land. We help Hardin County owners settle disputed claims through appraisal, inspecting on site.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/regions-served/paducah/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/paducah-downtown.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paducah-downtown-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paducah-downtown.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="846" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Western Kentucky · McCracken County</small><h2>Paducah</h2><span>Paducah sits where the Tennessee River meets the Ohio, and its claims reflect that: ice, wind and water. We help McCracken County owners settle disputed amounts through the appraisal clause.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/regions-served/frankfort/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/frankfort-capitol.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/frankfort-capitol-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/frankfort-capitol.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>The Bluegrass · Franklin County</small><h2>Frankfort</h2><span>Frankfort’s historic neighborhoods and Kentucky River valley create claims that need careful cause-and-cost work. We serve Franklin County owners with on-site inspections and appraisal representation.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/regions-served/hopkinsville/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tobacco-barns-pair.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tobacco-barns-pair-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tobacco-barns-pair.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="674" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Western Kentucky · Christian County</small><h2>Hopkinsville</h2><span>Christian County mixes farm country, military housing near Fort Campbell and a historic downtown. We help owners across the county settle claim disputes through appraisal, inspecting on site.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/regions-served/pikeville/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/mountain-hollow.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/mountain-hollow-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/mountain-hollow.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Eastern Kentucky · Pike County</small><h2>Pikeville</h2><span>Pike County’s steep hollows and river valleys shape every claim, from flash flooding to hillside slides. We travel to Pikeville and across the county to document losses and represent owners in appraisal.</span></span></a><a class="icard" href="/regions-served/ashland/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ohio-river-barge.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ohio-river-barge-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ohio-river-barge.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Eastern Kentucky · Boyd County</small><h2>Ashland</h2><span>Ashland’s riverfront location and older housing stock produce claims that need careful work. We serve Boyd County and neighboring areas with on-site inspections and appraisal representation.</span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head left reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Regions</p><h2>How claims differ across Kentucky</h2><p>The same policy wording plays out differently in a Paducah ranch, a Covington row house and a Pike County hillside home.</p></div><div class="rminis" data-stagger><div class="rmini"><h3>Louisville Metro</h3><p class="small">Jefferson, Oldham, Bullitt &amp; Hardin</p><p>Spring hail, Ohio Valley windstorms and older brick housing stock. The 2008 Ike windstorm showed how far inland a tropical remnant can reach.</p></div><div class="rmini"><h3>The Bluegrass</h3><p class="small">Fayette, Scott, Madison &amp; Franklin</p><p>Horse farms, historic downtowns and fast-growing subdivisions. Ice storms and hail lead the claim list, with barns and fencing in the mix.</p></div><div class="rmini"><h3>Northern Kentucky</h3><p class="small">Kenton, Boone &amp; Campbell</p><p>Nineteenth-century row houses, river-town flooding risk and hillsides prone to slippage — plus the same hail tracks that cross the Cincinnati metro.</p></div><div class="rmini"><h3>Eastern Kentucky</h3><p class="small">Pike, Boyd, Perry &amp; Letcher</p><p>Steep hollows funnel flash floods, as July 2022 showed. Hillside homes, manufactured housing and mine-subsidence questions shape claims here.</p></div><div class="rmini"><h3>Western Kentucky</h3><p class="small">McCracken, Daviess, Christian &amp; Graves</p><p>Tornado country. The December 2021 outbreak and the 2009 ice storm both left their deepest marks west of I-65.</p></div><div class="rmini"><h3>South Central</h3><p class="small">Warren, Barren &amp; Pulaski</p><p>Karst ground, sinkholes and fast growth around Bowling Green, which took an overnight tornado hit in December 2021.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="strip"><div class="wrap strip-in reveal"><div><h2>Don’t see your town?</h2><p>We cover every Kentucky county. Call and tell us where the property is.</p></div><p class="btns"><a class="btn coral" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn ghost-l" href="/contact-us/">Send the estimate</a></p></div></section>
</main>
